{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2",
        "label:i1->n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, Rental Items are Returned to the Store."
      ],
      "justification": "Initiates the process and captures the first return step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "guard:b1->n3",
        "label:n2->b1",
        "label:n3->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Customer returns the items to the store,\" then we can continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the customer return path. Condition decomposed into action/guard preserves branching behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4",
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "guard:b2->n5",
        "guard:b2->c1",
        "action:n5",
        "label:n4->b2",
        "label:n5->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Delivery Crew picks-up items at the event site,\" then we also continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the delivery crew pick-up path. Extra structural nodes do not change behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "converge:c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Customer returns the items to the store,\" then we can continue the process.",
        "However, if the \"Delivery Crew picks-up items at the event site,\" then we also continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Joins both alternative return paths back to the main flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6",
        "label:c1->n6",
        "label:n6->n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "During this step, the items are counted and compared to the original contract."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match for the counting and comparison step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7",
        "label:n7->b3",
        "guard:b3->n8",
        "action:n8",
        "label:n8->c2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Order is complete and all items were returned,\" then we proceed with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the complete order branch and continuation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9",
        "label:n9->b4",
        "guard:b3->n9",
        "guard:b4->n10",
        "action:n10",
        "label:n10->c2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Order is incomplete and items are missing,\" we still continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the incomplete order branch and continuation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "label:c2->n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Order is complete and all items were returned,\" then we proceed with the process.",
        "However, if the \"Order is incomplete and items are missing,\" we still continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Joins complete/incomplete paths before next decision."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11",
        "label:n11->b5",
        "guard:b5->n12",
        "action:n12",
        "guard:b5->c2",
        "label:n12->n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Similarly, if the \"Order is complete but items are damaged,\" we email the customer to inform them of the damage and additional charges."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches damaged item condition and notification action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n15",
        "label:n15->c2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Additionally, if there are damaged items and additional charges, we temporarily take them out of inventory."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match for removing damaged items from inventory."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13",
        "label:n13->b6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After this, if the \"Items are packed for an existing order,\" we continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Checks if items are packed for an existing order."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b6->n17",
        "guard:b6->c3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if the \"Items are stored for future orders,\" we also continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Routes to the storage or subsequent missing-items handling path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n17",
        "label:n17->b8",
        "guard:b8->n18",
        "action:n18",
        "guard:b8->c3",
        "label:n18->n21"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "In case of missing items and replacement charges, we email the customer to inform them."
      ],
      "justification": "Handles missing items condition and emails the customer."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n21",
        "label:n21->b10",
        "guard:b10->n22",
        "action:n22",
        "label:n22->c3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Customer returns the missing items,\" we continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models customer returning missing items path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b10->n23",
        "action:n23",
        "label:n23->c3",
        "label:c3->n24"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Customer does not return the missing items,\" we still continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models customer not returning missing items path and joins flows."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n24",
        "label:n24->b11",
        "guard:b11->n25",
        "action:n25",
        "label:n25->c4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Items are repaired and added into inventory,\" we continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures repair and inventory addition path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b11->n26",
        "action:n26",
        "label:n26->b12",
        "guard:b12->n27",
        "action:n27",
        "label:n27->c4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if the \"Items can't be repaired and are discarded,\" we email the customer with replacement charges."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures discard path and replacement charge email."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n28",
        "label:c4->n28",
        "label:n28->b13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Lastly, the items are packed for an existing order."
      ],
      "justification": "Final packing step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b13->n29",
        "action:n29",
        "label:n29->c4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Items are packed for an existing order,\" we continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Final packing routing decision."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b13->n30",
        "action:n30",
        "label:n30->b14",
        "guard:b14->n31",
        "action:n31",
        "label:n31->c4",
        "guard:b14->c4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Items are stored for future orders,\" we also continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Final storage routing decision."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n32",
        "label:c4->n32",
        "label:n32->n33"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The customer is then emailed with replacement charges"
      ],
      "justification": "Final replacement charge email notification."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n33"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once again, when the process is complete, it ends."
      ],
      "justification": "Marks process completion and terminates the flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "label:n33->e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "and the process is complete."
      ],
      "justification": "Marks process completion and terminates the flow."
    }
  ],
